function finishTurn(token){if(token!==battleToken)return;applyEndTurn(player[pi]);applyEndTurn(enemy[ei]);for(const m of [player[pi],enemy[ei]]){if(m?.gmaxActive){m.gmaxTurns--;if(m.gmaxTurns<=0)restoreForm(m);}}if(weatherState&&weatherTurns>0){weatherTurns--;if(weatherTurns<=0){clearWeather();setMessage('The weather returned to normal!',1100)}else $('fieldStatus').textContent=(weatherState==='rain'?'🌧 RAIN':weatherState==='sand'?'🌪 SANDSTORM':'❄️ SNOW')+` • ${weatherTurns} turns`; }if(allFainted(player)){lose();return}if(allFainted(enemy)){win();return}if(player[pi]?.fainted){promptForcedSwitch();return}turn++;busy=false;locked=false;render();setMessage(`What will ${player[pi].name} do?`,1000)}
